profile=Quality
profile.comment=Quality. Low: short shadows, none from mobs, no reflections, no ambient occlusion. Medium: shadows, reflections and ambient occlusion. High: adds sun rays and longer shadows. Ultra: the sharpest, longest shadows.
profile.LOW=Low
profile.MEDIUM=Medium
profile.HIGH=High
profile.ULTRA=Ultra

option.ABOUT=oh shiny!
option.ABOUT.comment=By simply-sunny, from the shaders ohjey made for Metallum Extra.
value.ABOUT.0=by simply-sunny

screen.LIGHTING=Lighting
screen.LIGHTING.comment=Shadows, colored light, the light in your hand and darker corners.
screen.SHADOW=Shadow Settings
screen.SHADOW.comment=Who casts shadows, the sun's path, and how shadow edges look.
screen.MATERIAL=Material
screen.MATERIAL.comment=How a resource pack's normal, specular and height maps (LabPBR, such as Vanilla Mashup PBR) change the look of blocks.
screen.ENVIRONMENT=Environment
screen.ENVIRONMENT.comment=Sun rays, fog, water and the wind.
screen.CAMERA=Camera
screen.CAMERA.comment=The glow around bright things and the dark corners of the picture.
screen.ANTIALIASING=Anti-aliasing
screen.ANTIALIASING.comment=Smooth edges and sharpening.

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=The sun and moon cast shadows. The most expensive setting.
option.MOB_SHADOWS=Mob Shadows
option.MOB_SHADOWS.comment=Mobs, players, chests and other block entities cast shadows too. Off is faster where there are many of them.
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS=Pixel Shadows
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS.comment=Shadows fall in whole pixels, like the game's textures, with blocky edges instead of soft ones.
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE=Shadow Pixels
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.comment=How many shadow pixels fit across a block. 16 matches the game's textures; fewer is chunkier. Needs Pixel Shadows.
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.4=4 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.8=8 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.16=16 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.32=32 per block
value.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SIZE.64=64 per block
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SOFT=Soft Pixel Edges
option.PIXEL_SHADOWS_SOFT.comment=Pixels at a shadow's edge are partly dark, as much of them as is in shadow. Edges stay in whole pixels but no longer flicker as you move. Needs Pixel Shadows.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Blur
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Blurs shadow edges, which hides their shimmer as you move. More costs a little more. Not used with Pixel Shadows.
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.1=Off
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.2=Light
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.3=Medium
value.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.4=Heavy
option.COLORED_LIGHT=Colored Light
option.COLORED_LIGHT.comment=Torches light orange, soul fire blue, sea lanterns teal, amethyst purple, redstone red.
option.HAND_LIGHT=Hand Light
option.HAND_LIGHT.comment=A torch, lantern or other light held in either hand lights up what is around you, in its own color with Colored Light.
