option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=A soft glow around bright things like the sun, lava and torches.
option.SMOOTH_EDGES=Smooth Edges
option.SMOOTH_EDGES.comment=Start here. Smooths jagged edges where one thing ends and another begins, leaving the blocks' own textures crisp. Not used with FXAA.
option.FXAA=FXAA
option.FXAA.comment=For when Smooth Edges leaves jagged edges behind. Smooths everything in the picture, textures too, so it's a little softer. Replaces Smooth Edges, and can go with TAA to smooth what it leaves.
option.TAA=TAA
option.TAA.comment=For when far-off blocks shimmer as you move. Each frame is drawn shifted a little and blended with the ones before, for the smoothest edges. Softens the picture: Sharpening brings it back.
option.SHARPENING=Sharpening
option.SHARPENING.comment=Sharpens the picture, most where it is flat and least across edges. Best with TAA, around 30 to 50%.
