option.FOG_AMOUNT=Fog
option.FOG_AMOUNT.comment=A haze over the last part of what you can see, Distant Horizons' far terrain included: at 20% the last 20%. Higher brings it nearer. From there it thickens the further and lower things are, so valleys fill with mist. Off: fog only at the edge of what is drawn.
